          "headline": "Ukrainian drones set Russia's Ust-Luga port area on fire; Baltic states sound alerts",
          "summary": "Ukrainian drones hit Russia's northwest overnight, starting a fire in the Ust-Luga Baltic export port area and injuring three, Reuters reported; Russia says it downed 146 drones over the Leningrad region. Lithuania, Latvia and Estonia issued shelter alerts as NATO jets were scrambled. Russian strikes cut power in parts of Kryvyi Rih, and Moscow says it hit a ship carrying arms for Ukraine near Odesa.",
